{"id": "11th_tamil_u1_q003", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_1", "lesson_id": "prose_speech_and_poem", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "valery_quote", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘கவிதை என்பது ஒரு நடனம்; உரைநடை என்பது ஒரு நடை போன்றது’ என்று கவிதைக்கும் உரைநடைக்கும் உள்ள வேறுபாட்டைக் கூறியவர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "வால்ட் விட்மன்", "B": "பாப்லோ நெருடா", "C": "பால் வலேரி", "D": "ஸ்டெபான் மல்லார்மே"}, "explanation": "பிரெஞ்சுக் கவிஞர் பால் வலேரி (Paul Valery), 'கவிதை என்பது நடனம் போன்றது; உரைநடை என்பது நடை போன்றது' என்று ஒப்பிட்டுக் கூறியுள்ளார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Who stated the distinction that 'Poetry is like dancing; prose is like walking'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Walt Whitman", "B": "Pablo Neruda", "C": "Paul Valery", "D": "Stephane Mallarme"}, "explanation": "French poet Paul Valery compared poetry to dancing and prose to walking."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 3, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 3", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "