{"id": "11th_tamil_u1_q004", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_1", "lesson_id": "prose_speech_and_poem", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "mallarme_quote", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘கவிதைகள் சொற்களால் இயற்றப்படுகின்றனவே அன்றி, எண்ணங்களால் அல்ல’ என்று கூறிய குறியீட்டுக் கவிஞர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "ஏர்னஸ்ட் காசிரர்", "B": "டி. எஸ். எலியட்", "C": "கார்ல் மார்க்ஸ்", "D": "ஸ்டெபான் மல்லார்மே"}, "explanation": "பிரெஞ்சுக் கவிஞர் ஸ்டெபான் மல்லார்மே (Stephane Mallarme), 'கவிதைகள் சொற்களால் உருவாவவை, வெறும் எண்ணங்களால் அல்ல' என்று திட்டவட்டமாகக் குறிப்பிட்டார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which symbolist poet famously stated that 'Poems are made with words, not with ideas'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Ernst Cassirer", "B": "T. S. Eliot", "C": "Karl Marx", "D": "Stephane Mallarme"}, "explanation": "French symbolist poet Stephane Mallarme declared that poetry is created from words, not merely from thoughts or ideas."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 3, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tam