{"id": "11th_tamil_u1_q005", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_1", "lesson_id": "prose_speech_and_poem", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "cassirer_quote", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘மொழி என்பது ஒரு குறியீட்டு அமைப்பு’ (Symbolic system) என்றும், ‘மனிதன் ஒரு குறியீட்டு விலங்கு’ என்றும் விளக்கிய தத்துவ அறிஞர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "ஏர்னஸ்ட் காசிரர்", "B": "ஜீன் பால் சார்த்தர்", "C": "பெர்ட்ரண்ட் ரஸல்", "D": "சாக்ரட்டீஸ்"}, "explanation": "ஜெர்மன் தத்துவ அறிஞர் ஏர்னஸ்ட் காசிரர் (Ernst Cassirer), மொழியை மனிதனின் குறியீட்டு அமைப்பு வடிவமாக விளக்கினார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which philosopher defined language as a 'symbolic system' and man as an 'animal symbolicum'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Ernst Cassirer", "B": "Jean-Paul Sartre", "C": "Bertrand Russell", "D": "Socrates"}, "explanation": "German philosopher Ernst Cassirer described language as a symbolic form and human as a symbolic animal."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 3, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 1