{"id": "11th_tamil_u1_q086", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_1", "lesson_id": "poem_nannool_paayiram", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "teacher_simile_nilam", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘அகழ்வாரைத் தாங்கும் நிலம்போலத் தன்பால் கற்போரின் பொறுமையின்மையை ஆற்றிப் பயன் தருபவர்’ - இந்நன்னூல் விளக்கம் எந்த உவமையைக் குறிக்கிறது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "மலை", "B": "நிலம்", "C": "நிறைகோல்", "D": "மலர்"}, "explanation": "தன்னைத் தோண்டுபவரையும் தாங்கும் நிலம் போல, மாணவர்களின் குறைகளையும் அறியாமையையும் பொறுத்துக் கொண்டு கல்வி வளம் தருவதால் நிலம் நல்லாசிரியருக்கு உவமையாயிற்று."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which archetype in Nannool symbolizes an instructor patiently bearing students' ignorance and flaws to bestow wisdom, like the earth bearing those who dig it?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Mountain", "B": "Earth (Nilam)", "C": "Balance Scales", "D": "Flower"}, "explanation": "Earth patiently bears those who excavate it; similarly, a noble teacher bears student limitations."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 8, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 8", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Unit 1", "Grammar", "Simile Interpretation"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_u1_q087", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_1", "lesson_id": "poem_nannool_paayiram", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "teacher_simile_niraikoal", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "நல்லாசிரியருக்கு உவமையான ‘நிறைகோல்’ (தராசு) உணர்த்தும் பண்பு யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "பணக்கார மாணவர்களுக்கு மட்டும் முன்னுரிமை தருவது", "B": "அளவுக்கு அதிகமாகத் தண்டிப்பது", "C": "எந்தச் சார்புமின்றி நடுவுநிலைமையோடு (ஐயமின்றி) உண்மையை உணர்த்துவது", "D": "அடிக்கடி தன் நிலையை மாற்றிக் கொள்வது"}, "explanation": "நிறைகோல் (தராசு) துலாக்கோல் போல ஒருபக்கமும் சாயாமல் நடுவுநிலையோடு எடையைக் காட்டுவது போல், ஆசிரியர் ஒருதலைப்பட்சமின்றி நடுவுநிலையோடு கற்பிக்க வேண்டும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What pedagogical virtue does the 'Niraikoal' (Balance Scale) simile embody for a noble teacher?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Favoring only wealthy students", "B": "Imposing excessive punishment", "C": "Unwavering neutrality and objective fairness without bias", "D": "Frequently vacillating in temperament"}, "explanation": "A balance scale is strictly unbiased and impartial; likewise an exemplary teacher practices strict objectivity."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "p