{"id": "11th_tamil_u1_q104", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_1", "lesson_id": "poem_nannool_paayiram", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "nannool_sutra_recitation", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘நிலம்மலை நிறைகோல் மலரென நால்வகை / உலகியல் அறிவோடு உயர்குண முடையோர்...’ - இந்நூற்பா யாரைப் போற்றுகிறது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "போர் வீரர்களை", "B": "வணிகர்களை", "C": "சிறந்த மாணாக்கர்களை", "D": "இலக்கண மரபு போற்றும் நல்லாசிரியரை"}, "explanation": "நிலம், மலை, நிறைகோல், மலர் ஆகிய பண்புகளோடு உலகியல் அறிவும் சிறந்த நற்குணங்களும் கொண்ட நல்லாசிரியரையே இந்நூற்பா சிறப்பிக்கிறது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whom does the celebrated verse 'Nilam malai niraikoal malarena naalvagai... ulagiyal arivoadu uyarguna mudaiyoar' extol?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Valiant warriors", "B": "Merchant traders", "C": "Superior students", "D": "Noble, accomplished teachers possessing exemplary pedagogical ethics"}, "explanation": "The verse eulogizes the cardinal virtues and pedagogical ethics of an ideal teacher."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "p