{"id": "11th_tamil_u1_q119", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_1", "lesson_id": "supplementary_aaraam_thinai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "riots_1958", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ஆசிரியர் அ. முத்துலிங்கம் கொழும்பு இரயில் நிலையத்தில் நூலிழையில் உயிர் தப்பிய அனுபவம் எந்த ஆண்டு நடைபெற்ற இனக்கலவரத்தின் போது நிகழ்ந்தது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1971", "B": "1983", "C": "1958", "D": "1965"}, "explanation": "1958-ஆம் ஆண்டு இலங்கையில் நடைபெற்ற பயங்கர இனக்கலவரத்தின் போது ஆசிரியர் கொழும்பு இரயில் நிலையத்தில் சிங்கள நண்பரால் காப்பாற்றப்பட்டு உயிர் தப்பினார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "During which historic anti-Tamil pogrom year did author A. Muthulingam narrowly escape death at Colombo railway station?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1971", "B": "1983", "C": "1958", "D": "1965"}, "explanation": "During the harrowing 1958 ethnic violence, he narrowly survived with the aid of a Sinhalese friend."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 11, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 11", "url": n