{"id": "11th_tamil_u1_q125", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_1", "lesson_id": "supplementary_aaraam_thinai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "diaspora_experience", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘ஆறாம் திணை’ கதையில் வெளிப்படும் புலம்பெயர் தமிழர்களின் பொதுவான மனநிலை யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "பனிபடர்ந்த புதிய நாடுகளில் வாழ்ந்தாலும், தாய்மண்ணின் நினைவுகளோடும் மொழி அடையாளத்தோடும் வாழும் ஏக்கம்", "B": "தாய்மொழியை முற்றிலுமாக மறந்துவிடத் துடிக்கும் எண்ணம்", "C": "சொந்த நாட்டை வெறுப்பது", "D": "பொருளாதார வளத்தில் மட்டுமே மூழ்கியிருப்பது"}, "explanation": "புலம்பெயர்ந்து குளிரிலும் பனியிலும் வாழ்ந்தாலும் அவர்களின் உள்ளம் தாய்மண்ணின் நினைவுகளையும் தமிழ் மொழியையும் இரு கண்களாகப் போற்றுகிறது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What universal psychic ethos of the displaced Tamil diaspora permeates the narrative of 'Aaraam Thinai'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Nostalgic yearning for ancestral homeland and resilient preservation of mother tongue amidst freezing snow-clad alien lands", "B": "A desperate urge to erase one mother tongue", "C": "Contempt for ancestral homeland", "D": "Sole obsession with material consumerism"}, "explanation": "The narrative vibrates with deep diasporic yearning, preserving cultural roots amidst exile."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 11, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 11", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Unit 1", "Supplementary", "Themes"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_u1_q126", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_1", "lesson_id": "supplementary_aaraam_thinai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "world_map_simile", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘உலக வரைபடத்தில் இலங்கை என்பது ஒரு சிறு புள்ளி; ஆனால்...’ - இதன் தொடர்ச்சியாக ஆசிரியர் உணர்த்துவது என்ன?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "இலங்கைக்கு வர்த்தக வலிமை அதிகம்", "B": "அங்கிருந்து புலம் பெயர்ந்த தமிழர்கள் உலக வரைபடம் முழுவதிலும் விரவிப் பரவிவிட்டனர்", "C": "இலங்கையில் மலைகள் அதிகம்", "D": "இலங்கையின் நிலப்பரப்பு நாளுக்கு நாள் விரிவடைகிறது"}, "explanation": "இலங்கை ஒரு சிறிய கண்ணீர்த்துளி வடிவத் தீவாக இருந்தாலும், போரினால் சிதறடிக்கப்பட்ட தமிழர்கள் உலகெங்கும் வாழ்கின்றனர் என்பதை இது குறிக்கிறது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In the metaphor 'Sri Lanka is but a minute teardrop speck on the world atlas; but...', what does the author conclude?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Sri Lanka possesses unmatched mercantile dominance", "B": "Its displaced Tamil diaspora has dispersed across virtually every coordinate of the global map", "C": "Sri Lanka has numerous mountains", "D": "Sri Lanka territory is expanding physically"}, "explanation": "Though the homeland is a tiny dot, its people's footsteps now span the entire globe."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 11, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 11", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Unit 1", "Supplementary", "Metaphor"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_u1_q127", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_1", "lesson_id": "supplementary_aaraam_thinai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "assertion_reason_diaspora", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கூற்று (A): அ. முத்துலிங்கம் பனியும் பனி சார்ந்த நிலப்பரப்பைத் தமிழர்களின் ‘ஆறாம் திணை’ எனப் பெயரிட்டு அழைக்கிறார்.\nகாரணம் (R): சங்க இலக்கியத்தில் குறிஞ்சி, முல்லை, மருதம், நெய்தல், பாலை மட்டுமே இருந்த சூழலில், இலட்சக்கணக்கான தமிழர்கள் தற்போது கனடா, லண்டன், நார்வே போன்ற கடும் குளிர்ப் பிரதேசங்களில் புலம்பெயர்ந்து வாழ்கின்றனர்.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கூற்று சரி, காரணம் தவறு", "B": "கூற்று தவறு, காரணம் சரி", "C": "கூற்று மற்றும் காரணம் இரண்டும் சரி; காரணம் கூற்றை மிகச்சரியாக விளக்குகிறது", "D": "கூற்று மற்றும் காரணம் இரண்டும் தவறு"}, "explanation": "சங்க மரபில் இல்லாத பனி நிலப்பரப்பில் வாழ நேரிட்ட வரலாற்று எதார்த்தத்தை 'ஆறாம் திணை' என ஆசிரியர் அழைப்பதால் கூற்றும் காரணமும் சரி."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Assertion (A): A. Muthulingam terms the snow-bound geographies of Tamil refugees as the 'Sixth Thinai'.\nReason (R): While Sangam poetics acknowledged only 5 Thinais, millions of displaced Tamils now inhabit sub-zero Arctic climates in Canada, the UK, and Scandinavia.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Assertion is true, Reason is false", "B": "Assertion is false, Reason is true", "C": "Both Assertion and Reason are true; Reason is the correct explanation", "D": "Both Assertion and Reason are false"}, "explanation": "Both assertion and reason are true as modern history extended traditional Sangam landscape categories."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 10, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 10", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Unit 1", "Supplementary", "Assertion-Reason"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_u1_q128", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_1", "lesson_id": "supplementary_aaraam_thinai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "muthulingam_style", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "அ. முத்துலிங்கத்தின் சிறுகதை நடையின் தனிச்சிறப்பு யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கடினமான வடமொழிச் சொற்களைப் பயன்படுத்துவது", "B": "நீண்ட தத்துவார்த்தப் பிரசங்கங்கள்", "C": "அழுத்தமான சோகத்தை மட்டுமே தொடர்ந்து பாடுவது", "D": "நுட்பமான அங்கதமும் (Humour), புன்னகையும், எளிய நேர்த்தியான சொல்லாட்சியும் கலந்த நடை"}, "explanation": "துயரமான சூழலிலும் கூட ஒரு மெல்லிய புன்னகையையும், நுட்பமான எள்ளல் மற்றும் நகைச்சுவை இழையோடும் நடையையுமே முத்துலிங்கம் கையாள்வார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What constitutes the hallmark prose signature of A. Muthulingam's short story style?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Dense Sanskritized terminology", "B": "Long pedantic philosophical homilies", "C": "Relentless melodramatic weeping", "D": "Subtle irony, underplayed humour, and effortless conversational elegance even while portraying tragedy"}, "explanation": "His style is internationally celebrated for understated irony, wit, and conversational grace."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 10, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 10", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Unit 1", "Supplementary", "Literary Style"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_u1_q129", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_1", "lesson_id": "supplementary_aaraam_thinai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "passport_check", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பாடப்பகுதியில் ஆசிரியர் வெளிநாடுகளுக்குச் செல்லும்போது அவரது அடையாளமாக உலகம் அறிந்தது எதனை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "அகதி (Refugee) அல்லது நாடற்றவன் என்ற துயர அடையாள அட்டை", "B": "அரச குடும்பச் சின்னம்", "C": "விவசாயக் குடும்ப அடையாளம்", "D": "மன்னரின் ஆணை"}, "explanation": "போரினால் சொந்த மண்ணை இழந்து புலம் பெயர்ந்த ஈழத்தமிழர்களுக்கு அந்நிய நாடுகளில் 'அகதி' என்ற முத்திரையே தொடக்க கால அடையாளமாக இருந்தது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What harrowing existential badge accompanied the exiled Tamil in foreign airports during initial decades of migration?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "The tragic tag of a displaced stateless Refugee", "B": "Royal insignia", "C": "Farmer identity badge", "D": "Monarchical decree"}, "explanation": "The painful existential stigma of being branded a stateless refugee shadowed their initial migration."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 11, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 11", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Unit 1", "Supplementary", "Themes"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
