{"id": "11th_tamil_u1_q135", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_1", "lesson_id": "supplementary_aaraam_thinai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "burning_consequence", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "யாழ்ப்பாண நூலக எரிப்புச் சம்பவம் உலக அளவில் எத்தகைய குற்றமாகக் கருதப்படுகிறது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "சாதாரண கட்டடச் சேதம்", "B": "விபத்து மட்டுமே", "C": "பண்பாட்டுப் படுகொலை (Cultural Genocide / Bibliocide)", "D": "சொத்துத் தகராறு"}, "explanation": "ஓர் இனத்தின் வரலாற்று மூலங்களையும் அறிவுப் பொக்கிஷங்களையும் திட்டமிட்டு அழித்த இந்நடவடிக்கை 'பண்பாட்டுப் படுகொலை' (Bibliocide) என உலக வரலாற்றில் குறிக்கப்படுகிறது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "How is the tragic incineration of the Jaffna Public Library categorized internationally by historians and jurists?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Ordinary structural fire damage", "B": "Purely accidental arson", "C": "Cultural Genocide (Bibliocide) - the intentional annihilation of an ancient intellectual heritage", "D": "Petty property squabble"}, "explanation": "Historians define the burning of Jaffna Library as a catastrophic cultural genocide (bibliocide)."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textb