{"id": "11th_tamil_u1_q183", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_1", "lesson_id": "revision_unit_1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "assertion_reason_entire_unit", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கூற்று (A): 11-ஆம் வகுப்பு முதல் இயல் ‘மொழி’ என்னும் கருப்பொருளை மையமாகக் கொண்டு நவீனக் கவிதை, மரபிலக்கணம், புலம் பெயர் இலக்கியம் ஆகியவற்றை ஒருங்கிணைக்கிறது.\nகாரணம் (R): ஒரு மொழி வெறும் இலக்கண விதிகளால் மட்டுமல்லாமல், அதன் உயிர்ப்பான பேச்சுமொழி, நவீன வெளிப்பாடுகள் மற்றும் மக்களின் வாழ்வியல் போராட்டங்கள் வழியாகவே என்றும் நிலைபெறுகிறது என்பதை உணர்த்துவதே இதன் நோக்கமாகும்.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கூற்று சரி, காரணம் தவறு", "B": "கூற்று தவறு, காரணம் சரி", "C": "கூற்று மற்றும் காரணம் இரண்டும் சரி; காரணம் கூற்றை மிகச்சரியாக விளக்குகிறது", "D": "கூற்று மற்றும் காரணம் இரண்டும் தவறு"}, "explanation": "மொழி என்பது மக்களின் உயிரோட்டம், இலக்கியம், போராட்டம் அனைத்தையும் உள்ளடக்கியது என்பதை இயல் 1 முழுமையாகப் படம்பிடிப்பதால் இரண்டும் சரி."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Assertion (A): Unit 1 of Class 11 holistically integrates modern poetics, classical grammar, and diasporic literature around the central theme of 'Language'.\nReason (R): It demonstrates that a language survives not merely through prescriptive canons, but through living spoken vitality and human resilience across history.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Assertion is true, Reason is false", "B": "Assertion is false, Reason is true", "C": "Both Assertion and Reason are true; Reason is the correct explanation", "D": "Both Assertion and Reason are false"}, "explanation": "Both assertion and reason are true as the unit orchestrates traditional grammar, modern aesthetics, and diasporic memory."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 5, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 5", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Unit 1", "Curriculum", "Assertion-Reason"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_u1_q184", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_1", "lesson_id": "revision_unit_1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "pyq_muthulingam_year", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC PYQ] அ. முத்துலிங்கம் ‘வம்சவிருத்தி’ சிறுகதைத் தொகுதிக்காக தமிழக அரசு பரிசு பெற்ற ஆண்டு எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1981", "B": "2001", "C": "2011", "D": "1996"}, "explanation": "அ. முத்துலிங்கம் 1996-ஆம் ஆண்டில் 'வம்சவிருத்தி' தொகுப்பிற்காகத் தமிழக அரசு பரிசு பெற்றார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC PYQ] In which year did A. Muthulingam receive the Government of Tamil Nadu Award for his collection 'Vamsaviruththi'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1981", "B": "2001", "C": "2011", "D": "1996"}, "explanation": "He was awarded the Tamil Nadu State Award in 1996."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 10, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 10", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": true, "exam": "TNPSC", "exam_name": "Group 2", "year": 2022, "paper": nu